1
00:00:40,506 --> 00:00:44,066
We have re -established three regiments and an aircraft fleet.

2
00:00:44,226 --> 00:00:46,106
K 4 in Arvidsjaur.

3
00:00:46,266 --> 00:00:48,466
AMF 4 in Gothenburg.

4
00:00:48,626 --> 00:00:50,746
In 13 in Falun.

5
00:00:50,906 --> 00:00:53,386
And F 16 in Uppsala.

6
00:00:53,546 --> 00:00:56,826
The bandages will contribute to a more sustainable organization -

7
00:00:56,986 --> 00:00:59,746
- Where we will continue to train more conscripts.

8
00:00:59,906 --> 00:01:04,346
And we get a clear geographical presence in strategically important areas.

9
00:01:04,506 --> 00:01:07,386
We have received new equipment but also renewed existing.

10
00:01:07,546 --> 00:01:10,426
Among other things, we have received the Robot System Patriot-

11
00:01:10,586 --> 00:01:14,906
- A brand new ability that meets the threat development in our immediate area.

12
00:03:44,426 --> 00:03:49,945
Our efforts in Mali are difficult and demanding, but of great importance to Africa and Europe.

13
00:03:51,405 --> 00:03:54,685
The effort for several years in Afghanistan has also made a difference.

14
00:03:55,106 --> 00:03:59,823
Our part in the evacuation from Afghanistan was an operation of the ultimate class.

15
00:04:00,786 --> 00:04:04,906
The Armed Forces play a central role in total defense development.

16
00:04:05,066 --> 00:04:09,226
How the total defense is to be developed has been made clear in action:

17
00:04:09,386 --> 00:04:12,845
The document that ÖB and DG MSB have agreed.

18
00:04:14,266 --> 00:04:17,746
We must never lose focus on our culture.

19
00:04:17,906 --> 00:04:22,106
How we are against each other, and with each other, is important for our ability.

20
00:04:22,266 --> 00:04:26,586
With clarifications on the development of the total defense and our central role -

21
00:04:26,746 --> 00:04:29,986
- In 2021 we have shown samples of foresight.

22
00:04:30,146 --> 00:04:34,986
So that Sweden is better equipped for tomorrow's threat.
